You gain proficiency with one type of artisan's tools (e.g., Arms & Cyberware Tech tools) and proficiency in System Forensics (Investigation).
Biometric Threat Scan (Level 7)
If you spend at least 1 minute observing or interacting with a target outside of combat, you can analyze their cybernetic tier, threat level, AC, HP, or physical ability scores relative to your own.
Tactical Command Reserve (Level 15)
When you roll initiative and have no Superiority Dice remaining, you immediately regain one Superiority Die.
Focus
Tactical maneuvers, squad coordination, and analyzing enemy vulnerabilities using corporate combat algorithms.*

Superiority Dice
You gain four d8 Superiority Dice to power tactical maneuvers.

Fire Discipline Command
Direct an ally to issue an immediate ranged or melee strike.

Joint Lock Disarm
Target a foe's cybernetic joints or weapon grip to force them to drop an item.

E Vector Dodge
Add a superiority die to your AC while moving through dangerous kill zones.

Counter Strike
Use your reaction when an enemy misses you to execute an immediate counter-attack.

Cyber-Mage Ronin
Cyber-Mage Spellcasting (Level 3) Spell-Blade Weave (Level 7) Data-Disrupting Strike (Level 10) Matrix Shift (Level 15) :::

You cast Wizard spells using Intelligence as your spellcasting ability, flavoring spells as active matrix code uploads (e.g., Overclock Reflexes for Shield, Blackout Arc for Thunderwave, or Hard-Light Decoy Array for Mirror Image).
Neural Weapon Sync (Level 3)
You perform a 1-hour neural synchronization with up to two weapons. Once synced, you cannot be disarmed of the weapon unless incapacitated, and you can summon it directly to your hand from anywhere on the same plane as a bonus action.
When you use your action to cast a cantrip (such as Data-Siphon or Neon Glitch), you can make one weapon attack as a bonus action.
When you hit a creature with a weapon attack, that creature has disadvantage on the next saving throw it makes against a spell you cast before the end of your next turn.
When you use your Synaptic Overclock (Action Surge), you can instantly teleport up to 30 feet to an unoccupied space you can see.
Focus
Blending high-frequency blade work with awakened matrix code and offensive digital spellcasting.*

